@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Customer / Staff" as User
participant "AccountPage / StaffPage" as UI
participant "App.jsx" as App
participant "BookingController" as Controller
participant "BookingWorkflowService" as Service
participant "SlotRepository / BookingRepository / InvoiceRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-31: Reschedule Booking ==

User -> UI : 1. Choose a different available slot
activate User
activate UI

UI -> App : 2. rescheduleBooking(newSlotId)
activate App

App -> App : 3. Validate UI state and build request
activate App
deactivate App

App -> Controller : 4. PUT /api/bookings/{bookingId}/reschedule
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. reschedule(bookingId, request)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. Visible pending/confirmed booking; different bookable slot
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Repo : 7. find slot; conflict check; save invoice
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. SELECT slot/booking; UPDATE booking; UPSERT invoice
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. Repriced Booking
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Reprice discounts; set remaining/refundable; notify
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Same/conflicting slot or invalid lifecycle -> HTTP 400
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 12. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 13. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> App : 14. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

App -> App : 15. refreshAll(); reload booking detail
activate App
deactivate App

App --> UI : 16. Show new slot and balance/refund
deactivate App

UI --> User : 17. Updated screen or error feedback

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
